You disperse into a mass of carrion worms, reforming near the target location ([6, 5, 4, 3, 2 (TL1-5)] teleport accuracy).

If used on a worm mass, you merge with it, moving to it's location, healing you for [248, 334, 401, 458, 508 (TL1-5; SP 100)], restoring [13, 23, 30, 37, 43 (TL1-5)] vim, and destroying the mass.
